\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God my Father, loving me,
\par Gave His Son, my friend to be:
\par Gave His Son, my form to take,
\par Bearing all things for my sake.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus still remains the same
\par As in days of old He came;
\par As my brother by my side,
\par Still He seeks my steps to guide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. How can I repay Thy love,
\par Lord of all the hosts above?
\par What have I, a child, to bring
\par Unto Thee, Thou heavenly King?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I have but myself to give:
\par Let me to Thy glory live;
\par Let me follow, day by day,
\par Where Thou showest me the way.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

